OL,3,GNEWSAIsland hosts inter-island
OL,4,Aenvironment summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental experts, conservation
OL,7,Fgroups and businesses from across the
OL,8,FBritish Isles and France have gathered
OL,9,Fin Guernsey for the 26th Inter-Island
OL,10,FEnvironment Meeting.
OL,12,FThe annual event, co-ordinated by the
OL,13,FGuernsey Nature Commission, brings
OL,14,Ftogether delegates to share ideas and
OL,15,Fdevelop joint projects aimed at
OL,16,Fprotecting the natural environment.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
