OL,3,GNEWSAIsland hosts inter-island
OL,4,Aenvironment summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year's theme, Nature for the Next
OL,7,FGeneration, includes talks on subjects
OL,8,Franging from seabird restoration and
OL,9,Fwoodland resilience to butterfly
OL,10,Fmonitoring in Sark and citizen science
OL,11,Fprojects.
OL,13,FA Sixth Form Environment Meeting gave
OL,14,Fyoung people the chance to present
OL,15,Fenvironmental issues that matter to
OL,16,Fthem and contribute ideas for the
OL,17,Ffuture.
